== Effects ==
* Gives a chance to drop a {{E|Half Soul Heart}} when [[Coins|money]] is collected. The chance is based on the coin's worth:<ref>The chance is calculated as 1-0.8334<sup>(coin_worth)</sup></ref>
{| class="wikitable"
 ! Coin
 ! Chance
